      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, SGTM.\n\nThat said, just a general note: I think if in some cases it\u0027s more practical to do both x86-generic and VMX-specific changes in one patch, we can do that, we don\u0027t need to dogmatically avoid doing that in all cases.",
