        "id": 2022314
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-02T22:26:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In both current uses of `for_each_initialized_cpu` we need to take the `vcpu` value (and if we have more uses of it in the future, we will likely need to do the same). So it would be nice to provide these `vcpu` values by `for_each_initialized_cpu` itself (similarly to `for_each_pkvm_guest_vcpu`)?",
      "revId": "39840fc852a6c638680e44e91c12e588a949d6a6",
