        "id": 4085392
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-03T02:44:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The intension of `for_each_initialized_cpu` is to iterate the CPU but not vCPU. If we would like to provide vcpu, then seems this macro should not be named as `for_each_initialized_cpu` but e.g.,`for_each_pkvm_host_vcpu_on_initialized_cpu` or just `for_each_pkvm_host_vcpu` for short? And maybe should not be defined in init.h but e.g., pkvm.h?",
      "parentUuid": "e23d3801_d66b3659",
      "revId": "39840fc852a6c638680e44e91c12e588a949d6a6",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
